  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734402",
      "title": "Understanding Lazy Loading",
      "sourceHash": "f1d7efb89652c8d22978033bbf640529b697810c77b1eebfe0de98a34070a2b9",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.11,
          "en": "Now for this course section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.11,
          "end": 7.59,
          "en": "I prepared a brand new example application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.59,
          "end": 10.77,
          "en": "a brand new example application which you find attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.77,
          "end": 13.59,
          "en": "where we fetch a list of dummy blog posts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.59,
          "end": 17.52,
          "en": "and can view the details of such a dummy blog post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.52,
          "end": 20.31,
          "en": "Therefore, as you can tell, it is rather simple,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.31,
          "end": 23.16,
          "en": "but it is an application that does use Routing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.16,
          "end": 27.06,
          "en": "that uses react-router and has a couple of routes set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 29.34,
          "en": "that has multiple page components therefor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.34,
          "end": 31.77,
          "en": "and multiple separate components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.77,
          "end": 33.96,
          "en": "that are used in those pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.96,
          "end": 37.17,
          "en": "And therefor, we're using various features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.17,
          "end": 39.45,
          "en": "about which you learn throughout the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.45,
          "end": 42.18,
          "en": "but the application actually isn't too important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.18,
          "end": 44.55,
          "en": "This section is about deployment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.55,
          "end": 46.77,
          "en": "and it is about preparing this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.77,
          "end": 48.96,
          "en": "for deployment as a first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.96,
          "end": 52.47,
          "en": "And for that, let's assume that we thoroughly tested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.47,
          "end": 54.72,
          "en": "that code, so we're happy with the code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.72,
          "end": 56.79,
          "en": "we don't wanna change it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.79,
          "end": 60.54,
          "en": "The next step then is to optimize that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.54,
          "end": 63.72,
          "en": "before we then finally build that app for production,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.72,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "so before we then finally produce the files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 69.21000000000001,
          "en": "that we will upload onto a server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.21000000000001,
          "end": 72,
          "en": "And therefor its this optimization step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72,
          "end": 75.3,
          "en": "on which I wanna focus in this lecture here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.3,
          "end": 77.88,
          "en": "And when it comes to optimizing that code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.88,
          "end": 80.52,
          "en": "we could of course look into techniques covered early",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.52,
          "end": 81.45,
          "en": "in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 81.45,
          "end": 83.07,
          "en": "For example, techniques covered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.07,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "in the, look behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 88.32,
          "en": "and optimization techniques course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.32,
          "end": 92.28,
          "en": "We could look into using React memo and things like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 92.28,
          "end": 94.65,
          "en": "But that's actually not what I wanna do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.65,
          "end": 96.24000000000001,
          "en": "even though we could do it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 96.24000000000001,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "but instead I want to introduce a new technique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 100.11,
          "en": "you should be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.11,
          "end": 102.12,
          "en": "And that would be lazy loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 104.85,
          "en": "which means that we wanna load certain pieces of code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 104.85,
          "end": 106.95,
          "en": "only when it's needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 106.95,
          "end": 110.13300000000001,
          "en": "But what exactly is lazy loading and how does it work?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 110.97,
          "end": 112.62,
          "en": "Well to understand lazy loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 112.62,
          "end": 116.16,
          "en": "it's important to understand how this project here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 116.16,
          "end": 120.93,
          "en": "will be built and served to end users without lazy loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 123.3,
          "en": "And for that, it's important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 123.3,
          "end": 126.15,
          "en": "that we have all these import statements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 126.15,
          "end": 131.07,
          "en": "in our various files where we import code from other files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.07,
          "end": 134.13,
          "en": "into the file where the import statement was added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.13,
          "end": 136.47,
          "en": "So for example, in this Blog.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 136.47,
          "end": 140.01,
          "en": "I'm importing use loader data from react-router-dom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 140.01,
          "end": 143.52,
          "en": "and that simply means that when this component file here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.52,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "is evaluated by the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 148.17000000000002,
          "en": "this code for this hook will be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.17000000000002,
          "end": 149.79,
          "en": "because this code is needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.79,
          "end": 152.49,
          "en": "in order to handle this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 152.49,
          "end": 155.64,
          "en": "this BlogPage component correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.64,
          "end": 157.38,
          "en": "That hopefully makes sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.38,
          "end": 159.63,
          "en": "We, for example, must import the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 159.63,
          "end": 161.46,
          "en": "for the PostList component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 161.46,
          "end": 163.44,
          "en": "before we can use that component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 163.44,
          "end": 165.75,
          "en": "in the BlogPage component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 165.75,
          "end": 168.78,
          "en": "So all these imports in the end connect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 168.78,
          "end": 170.4,
          "en": "these different files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 170.4,
          "end": 173.76,
          "en": "And when this application is served to end users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 173.76,
          "end": 176.01,
          "en": "all these imports must be resolved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 176.01,
          "end": 178.56,
          "en": "before something's shown on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 178.56,
          "end": 180.39,
          "en": "That hopefully also makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 180.39,
          "end": 182.97,
          "en": "if all these code pieces depend on each other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 182.97,
          "end": 184.44,
          "en": "all code must be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 184.44,
          "end": 187.89,
          "en": "before something can be shown to the end user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 187.89,
          "end": 190.89,
          "en": "Now actually, when we later build this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 190.89,
          "end": 193.14,
          "en": "something we'll do in one of the next lectures,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 193.14,
          "end": 195.96,
          "en": "then all these imported files will actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 195.96,
          "end": 198.6,
          "en": "be merged together into one big file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 198.6,
          "end": 200.49,
          "en": "But even if that would not be the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 200.49,
          "end": 202.26,
          "en": "we would as I just mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 202.26,
          "end": 204.27,
          "en": "have to resolve all these imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 204.27,
          "end": 206.433,
          "en": "in order to bring something on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 207.32999999999998,
          "end": 210.51,
          "en": "Now the theoretical problem with that is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 210.51,
          "end": 213.75,
          "en": "that of course, this means all code files must be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 213.75,
          "end": 216.03,
          "en": "before anything's shown on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 216.03,
          "end": 218.88,
          "en": "And for this simple application, that's no problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 218.88,
          "end": 223.07999999999998,
          "en": "It is a really simple application with only a few code files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 223.07999999999998,
          "end": 226.53,
          "en": "so it's not a problem that we have to load them all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 226.53,
          "end": 228.9,
          "en": "But of course, in more complex applications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 228.9,
          "end": 231.81,
          "en": "in bigger apps with dozens or even hundreds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 231.81,
          "end": 235.23,
          "en": "of routes and components, that could be a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 235.23,
          "end": 237.72,
          "en": "Having to load all the code initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 237.72,
          "end": 240.99,
          "en": "will slow down that initial page load.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 240.99,
          "end": 244.05,
          "en": "When the user visits that website for the first time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 244.05,
          "end": 245.94,
          "en": "all that code must be downloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 245.94,
          "end": 248.46,
          "en": "before anything's showing up on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 248.46,
          "end": 251.46,
          "en": "And therefore that initial load can take quite long",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 251.46,
          "end": 253.92,
          "en": "and leads to a bad user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 253.92,
          "end": 256.68,
          "en": "Again, not a problem for this simple site",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 256.68,
          "end": 259.023,
          "en": "but can be a problem for bigger sites.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 260.04,
          "end": 263.07,
          "en": "And that's exactly where lazy loading comes into play.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 263.07,
          "end": 264.93,
          "en": "The idea behind lazy loading is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 264.93,
          "end": 268.2,
          "en": "that we load certain components in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 268.2,
          "end": 272.28,
          "en": "only when they're needed instead of ahead of time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 272.28,
          "end": 274.05,
          "en": "And therefor even though it's not needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 274.05,
          "end": 275.94,
          "en": "for this basic application here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 275.94,
          "end": 277.47,
          "en": "as it is rather simple,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 277.47,
          "end": 279.69,
          "en": "we're now going to add lazy loading to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 279.69,
          "end": 281.37,
          "en": "so that you learn how it works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 281.37,
          "end": 284.07,
          "en": "and so that you could apply that lazy loading technique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 284.07,
          "end": 285.933,
          "en": "to more complex sites as well.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}